# Art whose licence forbids redistributing the files (ToffeeCraft cats, Top Down Garden Castle, Cainos,
# and the Sprout Lands interface).
# It ships only inside the private artifact; rebuild it with catio/tools/build-art.py.
catio/art/licensed/

__pycache__/
catio/test/.page.html
catio/test/.page-noart.html
catio/test/.noart/
catio/test/.look/
# Your own cafe: the rooms it opens with, your projects and the words that point at each, the saved copy of
# your sessions, and the digests made from it. Every one of them names your repos, so none is committed. A
# clone starts with no rooms at all, which is exactly what opens the setup wizard.
catio/data/rooms.json
catio/data/projects.json
catio/data/sessions.json
catio/data/digest.md
catio/data/digest.json
# Her session titles, sifts and anything else private: kept on disk, never committed.
catio/data/private/
catio/dist/

# graphify's map of the repo: a local build (graphify update .)
graphify-out/

# the C++ app draft: its build, and the frames catio_look renders (they show the licensed art)
catio-app/build/
catio-app/.look/
